,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.1549,"r5":0.2149,"r20":0.3589,"r1_spy":0.1494,"r5_spy":0.2098,"r20_spy":0.3804}},{"id":"ICLR 2026 Q3","t":"ICLR","d":"2026-10-28","time":"bmo","w":10576,"n":52,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/icon-iclr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,0,1,0.95],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[10,9,1,9.55],"cost_cuts":[1,0,1,0.95],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.1704,"r5":0.1136,"r1_spy":0.167,"r5_spy":0.1335}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ICLR 2018 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"All of this has created significant value for our shareholders resulting in a 15% share price increase in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/icon-plc-iclr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2018 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"We are effectively leveraging the industry's leading global business support model focused on best-in-class delivery while maximizing proactive cost saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/icon-plc-iclr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2018 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2019-02-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"As we look forward to the end of the year, I want to make -- take this opportunity to reaffirm our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/icon-plc-iclr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"From this quarter going forward, all business win and backlog-related financial measures will comprise of both direct fee and pass-through components.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/icon-iclr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"I think as we've been fairly vocal over, well, a number of years now around the inherent unreliability of the book-to-bill metrics and I could probably talk for days about that, I think including pass-through cost now probably makes that even worse, so makes it even more unreliable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/icon-iclr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"All of this helps to take significant time and cost out of our customers' development programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/icon-iclr-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Curtain","x":"Starting last quarter, all business win and backlog-related financial measurements comprise both direct fee and pass-through components.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/icon-iclr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"So as a result of that, Bob, a lot of their revenue, about 80% of their revenue already goes through our investigator payments, if you like, our pass-through lines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/icon-iclr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Curtain","x":"In addition, the comments of both Brendan and Steve will exclude the impact of Quarter 2, 2018 restructuring charge, when quoting year-over-year comparisons. [Operator instructions] I would now like to hand over the call to our CFO, Mr. Brendan Brennan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/icon-iclr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"As we look forward to the end of the year, I want to take this opportunity to reiterate our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/icon-iclr-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Curtain","x":"All business win and backlog-related financial measurements comprise both direct fee and pass-through components.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/icon-iclr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"We have developed a strong positive culture within our support structure that is focused on best-in-class service delivery and appropriate cost-saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/icon-iclr-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2020-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Curtain","x":"All business win and backlog-related financial measurements comprised both direct fees and pass-through components.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/icon-iclr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"This problem is prevalent in most therapeutic areas, particularly oncology, where the focus is on effectively selecting the right size and driving the recruitment of narrowly defined subsets of patients into trials in a timely and effective manner.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/icon-iclr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2020-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"Notwithstanding the challenges that the coronavirus situation brings, I want to take this opportunity to reaffirm our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/icon-iclr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2019 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2020-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"Having said and reiterating guidance, we do believe and we are making some assumptions that it will figure out in the next month or so.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/icon-iclr-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2020-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"In terms of pass-through, I don't think that's going to make a huge difference.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/icon-iclr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2020-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"The pass-throughs in terms of monitoring a pretty modest -- a major part of the pass-through costs are investigator fees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/icon-iclr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"Nevertheless, as we are not immune to the impact of COVID-19, we are taking immediate and proactive cost reduction measures to protect jobs, maintain our business performance and ensure that we are ready to move quickly when business conditions improve later in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/icon-iclr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"And again, as I said, the ability for us as an organization to move and shift and redeploy resources, take significant resource cost out in one area and deploy them in another where we're actually earning solid revenues is, I think, a strength of our organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/icon-iclr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"During the quarter, we took a restructuring charge of $18 million as we continue to improve the efficiency of our operating model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/icon-plc-iclr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"This restructuring plan reflected rationalization across the business to improve resource utilization and our office footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/icon-plc-iclr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"I think what we do see on vaccine trials is obviously a heavier element of pass-through costs, as proportionality of the total and cost of the trial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"We certainly have obviously seen our share of vaccine work and pass-through, it's certainly a larger element than what we've seen in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Colin Shannon","x":"But it's going to be a joint combination of us working very closely with our partners and clients to ensure that we streamline that approach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/icon-plc-iclr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2020 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Brennan","x":"And then I know it was asked earlier too on the $150 million of cost savings, and you said you'll give us more color on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/icon-plc-iclr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mr. Brendan Brennan","x":"And in terms of pass-through elements of our revenue, it certainly wasn't isolated to our top customer, and that was across more than that in certainly in the top five.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/icon-plc-iclr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mr. Brendan Brennan","x":"Obviously, we have -- as I said, there is -- and it's not just our biggest client, it's across the top clients, there's obviously an impact from pass-through that comes along with COVID and particularly in vaccine work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/icon-plc-iclr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dr. Steve Cutler","x":"And we believe as we work through the integration, we'll streamline those relationships.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/icon-plc-iclr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dr. Steve Cutler","x":"As we progress through the remainder of the year, we expect our pass-through mix to begin to return to a more normalized level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/icon-plc-iclr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dr. Steve Cutler","x":"I think the only thing I'd add to that, Erin, is we've been involved as PRA, as I said, with the larger of these vaccine trials, which have had a significant pass-through element in the first half of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/icon-plc-iclr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dr. Steve Cutler","x":"And quite frankly, the labor market across the world is kind of restructuring as we come out of this pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/icon-plc-iclr-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"And that, of course, reflects as we have always done, the pass-through elements coming into the historical PRA backlog and that entire piece being added to the historic icon backlog.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"I'm just curious if you can give us any sense, even if it's more qualitative on how pass-through bookings are coming in or what you see happening?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan Brennan","x":"Adjusted EBITDA excludes stock compensation expense, restructuring costs, foreign currency gains and losses, amortization and transaction and integration rated costs and their respective tax benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2021 Q3","e":"iclr","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"With the strong performance in the third quarter, we are increasing our 2021 outlook with revenue guidance in the range of $5.43 billion to $5.53 billion, and adjusted earnings per share guidance in the range of $9.55 to $9.75, up 1.5% and 3.8%, respectively, from the midpoint of our previous…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/icon-plc-iclr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"We continue to expect that, pass through revenue mix will increase in the first half of 2025, which will pressure our EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nigel Clerkin","x":"And for this year, just given some of the pressures we talked about before, particularly the pass through Steve mentioned in H1 especially, we would expect our full year margins to be probably somewhere around 1% lower this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Unidentified Analyst","x":"How are you thinking about the trade-off on these cost-cutting versus your views on growth?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Matt Sykes","x":"But I just want to focus on one topic regarding policy uncertainty and specifically the reports of FDA headcount reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"Moving to this year, we are reaffirming our full year guidance range that we issued last month, which reflects the current transition period, in which we are operating.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2024 Q4","e":"iclr","d":"2025-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"So at the moment, as I say reaffirming guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"I saw some comments just recently from the White House around a delayed implementation of any pharma tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jack Meehan","x":"Wanted to ask a couple of tariff-related questions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kate Haven","x":"Adjusted EBITDA, adjusted net income, and adjusted diluted earnings per share exclude stock compensation expense, restructuring costs, foreign currency gains and losses, amortization and transaction-related and integration-related costs and their respective tax benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Cutler","x":"By streamlining processes and unifying platform technology across our operational units, we are seeing better performance on our study cycle times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q1","e":"iclr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ryskin","x":"So you cut the full year guide by I think 400 million at the midpoint, then as you said, 350 of that is just attributed to the two next gen COVID trials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Bernard Donnelly","x":"Did you hear any changes from the pharma customers, just given all the noise on tariffs, MFN, et cetera?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven A. Cutler","x":"Our revenue performance was ahead of expectations, assisted by higher pass-through revenue in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven A. Cutler","x":"Overall adjusted EBITDA margin increased over quarter 1 to 19.6% with solid cost control offsetting higher pass-through revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICLR 2025 Q2","e":"iclr","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nigel Clerkin","x":"While overall cash collections were solid in quarter 2, our free cash flow was lower than quarter 1, reflecting the timing of interest and tax payments as well as restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/20/icon-iclr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ICL